<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-13T17:55:57.496Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:55:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-linked fighters have killed dozens of civilians in Ebola-hit eastern DR Congo while Allied Democratic Forces militants attacked the Cantine area in North Kivu, intensifying insecurity. Armed groups continue to impede Ebola response, with attacks on health workers and the spread of the disease into rural areas. The conflict still accounts for 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. New developments include the capture of an alleged ADF intelligence officer by the DR Congo army and the rotation of UPDF troops in the region as the ADF threat persists.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBqQ01qb3lwNWhSR0VzZy1pZ2Rxa0VKNllXa0FOaGVJeWg5bnROUm9VaGZhODYwbnQ0Rl9VbXd3THBCMU5LR2tyQkVUWVl1cmFDZV8xckVvaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPZG1waG1xOHJUdGpBcUdNUXNmSUJ6bUctdFFZMmw4OVhPUmdUTzdSMVJWOFJ1N1dLWDVVcVh6MDY5VlRmT2tZSFJIWFZrU1E2RmxtV1JRaDE0Q3dJcEVtMHUza3Z2d1Bla3FMcWZqeUgxRjBZQ1pEODhzUHVHZHA0aFBSZXdlWElQU1JxbVE3cEtYS01Nel9XbUNxbGwwYXVVQVlCUHA4YTIyS0RjVTVPMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQMzF6cTFJdnNVNHhxaEtScGpvUXlVTzhvUHZkWjlLNFpiNUJmc0E4MDRISGJUeU44dldueVVhTTBCaHhZRE9MSEhoN3BQdnZTQkZOUTN2VzNvMS1rRkRYV1FBX2RWczVRc2JmTm15eVJ6eEhycXRfQVA2dk00OWNoSV85ME16ZFBtXzNULVFiQVFzXzBBLVU3dFlKMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Norwegian Refugee Council&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNdlZTMVNjQmUyWlpWLXV6OHRHbHFvcU93cHF1dmVDaVlhMW9Ha2FxVlZoRnRORi1uaDJTLUE3WDhUdzM0N29GSXJpRko1aXJWM2JRbFhxOWg2QlV3RmNveFlYVWdVM2tDVmZ2cXFUeW12VURLcUlqZnIxZ3NDZlo3bExiTFVtTzhKX2